        <div class="num">Our story — Oliver Hudson</div>
        <h2>Built by someone tired of the <em>gym-bag pharmacy.</em></h2>
        <p>I'm Oliver — I played tennis for years, and my training bag was ridiculous: a pre-workout, an electrolyte tub, magnesium, a focus supp, creatine. Five tubs, five price tags, and I still never knew the doses.</p>
        <p>So I built the opposite. One stick — a stim-free pre-workout, real electrolytes, focus and recovery, with <strong>3g creatine and 3g citrulline at doses you can read right off the pack</strong>. No caffeine. No celebrity on the label. Just the doses.</p>
